window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A society that you can't escape...or you can die trying.</b></p> <p>Embracing her wolf, Raven became stronger than she ever imagined, but the next challenges she must face could break her. The culling was coming. Only the strongest survive, and with it, the potential to change everything and everyone around her.</p> <p>Now, Raven and her friends must make decisions unlike anything they ever could have imagined. Their choices would set the course of a war. Their enemies were many, and even unknown.</p> <p>Once again, Raven was left with no other options. If she doesn't take a stand, she would lose everything she held close.</p> <p>Vampire Diaries meets Daughter of the Moon in <i>Year Three: Bloodshed Academy</i>, a steamy academy romance story for listeners who love snark and strong alphas.</p> <p><b>Scroll up and buy now to start this academy romance today. </b></p> <p><b>Please note:</b> The story is not reverse harem, and there are instances of bullying.</p>"; 
